- Circular arrangements “increasing along each arc from 1” (numbers 1..n placed on a circle):
  - Correct interpretation/solution strategy:
    - Fix 1 to remove rotational symmetry.
    - Place numbers 2,3,...,n−1 one by one so that each next integer is adjacent to the current consecutive block starting from 1; each step has 2 choices (attach clockwise or counterclockwise end).
