- Use python_eval for nontrivial arithmetic, symbolic manipulation, exhaustive checks, searches, or verification.
- Make each python_eval call self-contained: include all imports and definitions used in that call. The sandbox is shared within a problem but may reset after failures; do not rely on prior state unless you just created it in the same episode and the previous call succeeded.
